{
    "title": "NBC10 Philadelphia Local News",
    "description": "The NBC10 Philadelphia news and weather app connects you with all things Philly. It is your gateway to local news, weather updates, and a free NBC10 Philadelphia News 24/7 streaming channel. The app is free to download and easy to use, offering customizable breaking news alerts and weather notifications tailored to your location through convenient app settings.\r\n\r\nWith this app, you tap into the expertise of the award-winning NBC10 Philadelphia news team, covering the issues vital to residents in Greater Philadelphia, the Lehigh Valley, South Jersey, and Delaware. The NBC10 First Alert weather meteorologists provide accurate local forecasts, ensuring app users stay informed  wherever they go. Experience a comprehensive range of features, including powerful weather radar, local traffic updates, NBC Sports Philadelphia news, live coverage of developing stories in Philly and beyond, as well as updates on entertainment, lifestyle, business, and financial insights \u2013 all consolidated in one user-friendly app.\r\n\r\nThe NBC10 Philadelphia app helps you stay informed with the following features:\r\n\r\nPHILLY NEWS ALERTS \r\n+ Alerts for Philly local news, breaking news, sports, commuter alerts, and other alerts that can be personalized and managed in the app settings\r\n+Top News of the day covering breaking news, local Philly politics, urgent consumer product recalls and other topics\r\n+ Latest news feed that shows all articles and videos published in reverse chronological order\r\n+ Alerts center that shows you the most urgent Philly news stories of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications\r\n+Trending section where you can discover daily, buzz-worthy topics in Philly news and pop culture \r\n\r\nNBC10 PHILADELPHIA FIRST ALERT WEATHER\r\n+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules you can rearrange \r\n+ Upgraded location hub to add new locations and set up weather alerts \r\n+ Live Philly weather updates from the StormRanger10 mobile tracking radar\r\n+ 10-day forecasts for your location in Greater Philadelphia, the Lehigh Valley, South Jersey or Delaware \r\n+ Hourly forecasts featuring a customizable graph\r\n+ Local weather maps and radar  \r\n+ Local weather forecast data that includes UV index, air quality and other live weather conditions \r\n+ Weather alerts for every location you save in the app\r\n+ Weather closings for Philly area schools\r\n+ Weather news videos from your local meteorologists \r\n\r\nNBC10 PHILADELPHIA NEWS 24/7 STREAMING CHANNEL\r\n+ Free 24/7 NBC Philadelphia news streaming channel\r\n+ Live NBC10 Philadelphia newscasts \r\n+ Breaking news live coverage of news briefings and other urgent news events in the Philly area\r\n+ Dedicated video page with the latest video feed \r\n\r\nNBC PHILADELPHIA I-TEAM INVESTIGATIONS & MORE\r\n+ Investigative stories from local and award-winning NBC10 journalists\r\n+ Consumer reports from NBC10 Responds fight to recoup consumers\u2019 hard-earned money \r\n+ Sports news from NBC Sports Philadelphia\r\n+ Business news, finance news and stock market news from CNBC\r\n+ Entertainment news from E! Online and Access \r\n+ Lifestyle and entertainment news from NBC TODAY show\r\n\r\nNBC10 Philadelphia is part of the NBCUniversal Local group, which includes ten other NBC stations, 17 Telemundo Stations, four regional sports networks, including NBC Sports Philadelphia, and NECN (New England Cable News). NBC10 (WCAU) has been providing news and entertainment to the Delaware Valley for nearly 70 years. \r\n\r\n\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=Owned_Stations&intake=NBC_10_Philadelphia/ \r\nCA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_10_Philadelphia",
    "descriptionHTML": "The NBC10 Philadelphia news and weather app connects you with all things Philly. It is your gateway to local news, weather updates, and a free NBC10 Philadelphia News 24/7 streaming channel. The app is free to download and easy to use, offering customizable breaking news alerts and weather notifications tailored to your location through convenient app settings.<br><br>With this app, you tap into the expertise of the award-winning NBC10 Philadelphia news team, covering the issues vital to residents in Greater Philadelphia, the Lehigh Valley, South Jersey, and Delaware. The NBC10 First Alert weather meteorologists provide accurate local forecasts, ensuring app users stay informed  wherever they go. Experience a comprehensive range of features, including powerful weather radar, local traffic updates, NBC Sports Philadelphia news, live coverage of developing stories in Philly and beyond, as well as updates on entertainment, lifestyle, business, and financial insights \u2013 all consolidated in one user-friendly app.<br><br>The NBC10 Philadelphia app helps you stay informed with the following features:<br><br>PHILLY NEWS ALERTS <br>+ Alerts for Philly local news, breaking news, sports, commuter alerts, and other alerts that can be personalized and managed in the app settings<br>+Top News of the day covering breaking news, local Philly politics, urgent consumer product recalls and other topics<br>+ Latest news feed that shows all articles and videos published in reverse chronological order<br>+ Alerts center that shows you the most urgent Philly news stories of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications<br>+Trending section where you can discover daily, buzz-worthy topics in Philly news and pop culture <br><br>NBC10 PHILADELPHIA FIRST ALERT WEATHER<br>+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules you can rearrange <br>+ Upgraded location hub to add new locations and set up weather alerts <br>+ Live Philly weather updates from the StormRanger10 mobile tracking radar<br>+ 10-day forecasts for your location in Greater Philadelphia, the Lehigh Valley, South Jersey or Delaware <br>+ Hourly forecasts featuring a customizable graph<br>+ Local weather maps and radar  <br>+ Local weather forecast data that includes UV index, air quality and other live weather conditions <br>+ Weather alerts for every location you save in the app<br>+ Weather closings for Philly area schools<br>+ Weather news videos from your local meteorologists <br><br>NBC10 PHILADELPHIA NEWS 24/7 STREAMING CHANNEL<br>+ Free 24/7 NBC Philadelphia news streaming channel<br>+ Live NBC10 Philadelphia newscasts <br>+ Breaking news live coverage of news briefings and other urgent news events in the Philly area<br>+ Dedicated video page with the latest video feed <br><br>NBC PHILADELPHIA I-TEAM INVESTIGATIONS &amp; MORE<br>+ Investigative stories from local and award-winning NBC10 journalists<br>+ Consumer reports from NBC10 Responds fight to recoup consumers\u2019 hard-earned money <br>+ Sports news from NBC Sports Philadelphia<br>+ Business news, finance news and stock market news from CNBC<br>+ Entertainment news from E! Online and Access <br>+ Lifestyle and entertainment news from NBC TODAY show<br><br>NBC10 Philadelphia is part of the NBCUniversal Local group, which includes ten other NBC stations, 17 Telemundo Stations, four regional sports networks, including NBC Sports Philadelphia, and NECN (New England Cable News). NBC10 (WCAU) has been providing news and entertainment to the Delaware Valley for nearly 70 years. <br><br><br>Your Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=Owned_Stations&amp;intake=NBC_10_Philadelphia/ <br>CA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_10_Philadelphia",
